---
import "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<MainLayout title="About">
  <p>
    I'm a <mark>Director of Engineering</mark> and <mark
      >full-stack web developer</mark
    >
    at <a href="https://www.codecraftworks.com/" target="_blank"
      ><img
        src="/img/codey.svg"
        alt="Codey, the Codecraft Works mascot"
        width="24px"
        height="24px"
        class="inline"
      />
      Codecraft Works</a
    >, where I lead software development on an education technology platform.
  </p>
  <p>
    I am a graduate of <img
      src="/img/ucf.svg"
      width="24px"
      height="24px"
      class="inline"
      alt="UCF University of Central Florida"
    /> (Go Knights!) but I consider myself a life-long learner, technologist, and
    tech early-adopter. I currently do work in Astro, Firebase, Google Cloud, .NET,
    AWS, and STEM education.
  </p>
  <p>
    I am the organizer for <a href="https://space-coast.dev" target="_blank"
      >Space Coast Devs</a
    > and help the local mesh community by running the <a
      href="https://scmesh.org/"
      target="_blank">Space Coast Mesh</a
    > website. I help organize the yearly <a
      href="https://devfestflorida.com"
      target="_blank">DevFest Florida</a
    > in Orlando. I also volunteer as a coach for a cybersecurity team for students
    in grades 6–12 through the
    <a href="https://codecraftfoundation.org/" target="_blank"
      >Codecraft Foundation</a
    > called <a href="https://c11y.org/" target="_blank">c11y</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    This site is my digital garden: a place for <a href="/notes">notes</a>,
    experiments, and ideas that can grow and connect over time. I write in
    Obsidian, publish with a small custom plugin, and use Astro to turn that
    work into the site you are reading. The <a href="/colophon">colophon</a> has the
    technical and design details.
  </p>
</MainLayout>
